 "text": "Samoa's acting prime minister said late Sunday an oil spill from a grounded New Zealand navy ship that sank and caught fire off the coast of Samoa is, quote, \"highly probable.\" Officials in the Pacific island nation are conducting an environmental impact assessment in the area where the ship sank on Sunday morning. New Zealand's chief of Navy said all 75 people on board were taken to safety on life rafts.",
